{"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"sections":[],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Type Method","externalID":"c:objc(pl)PWConfiguration(cm)handlePushRegistration:","fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"handlePushRegistration:"}],"modules":[{"name":"PushwooshCore"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"handlePushRegistration:","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"handlePushRegistration:","symbolKind":"method"},"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/handlePushRegistration:"},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ ("},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:v","text":"void","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"text":"handlePushRegistration:","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSData","text":"NSData","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":" *) "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"deviceToken"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}],"languages":["occ"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"name":"deviceToken","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The device token Data received from APNs"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Call this method from your AppDelegate’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"application:didRegisterForRemoteNotificationsWithDeviceToken:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"to forward the device token to Pushwoosh.","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The SDK normally handles this automatically via method swizzling, but you may need to call","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"this directly if:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You’ve disabled swizzling"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You’re managing multiple push providers"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"You need custom token processing","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"level":2,"text":"Example","anchor":"Example","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Manual token handling with multiple push providers:","type":"text"}]},{"code":["class AppDelegate: UIResponder, UIApplicationDelegate {","","    func application(_ application: UIApplication,","                    didRegisterForRemoteNotificationsWithDeviceToken deviceToken: Data) {","","        \/\/ Convert token to string for logging","        let tokenString = deviceToken.map { String(format: \"%02.2hhx\", $0) }.joined()","        Logger.info(\"Received APNs token: \\(tokenString.prefix(20))...\")","","        \/\/ Send to Pushwoosh","        Pushwoosh.configure.handlePushRegistration(deviceToken)","","        \/\/ Send to other push providers if needed","        FirebaseMessaging.messaging().apnsToken = deviceToken","","        \/\/ Sync with backend","        BackendAPI.shared.updatePushToken(tokenString)","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Only use this method if you need manual control."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"Manually handles the device push token registration.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/handlepushregistration:"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"references":{"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore":{"abstract":[{"text":"Core foundation module for Pushwoosh SDK.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoos